Canonical OR-058 coverage for exact-String case subjects, subject-once evaluation, ordered lazy Regex search, explicit anchors, Unicode properties, empty matching, explicit else, and unconstructed later invalid patterns; no captures, binding, public Regex API, or later-row behavior.
